I was just a few hundred turns away from my second game finish with a
Priest on the plane of air when a few Titans and angels started a
recursive summon free-for-all that almost completely filled the level
with monsters.

I was around level 22 or 23, and had pretty much everything (close to
-50 AC, pretty much every spell, all intrinsics).

Because I had found pretty much everything I needed by the time I got
to wish, (including a poly-pile of enchant armor scrolls) I used the
opportunity to play around with genociding to see how much easier it
would make the game.

In addition to L, h, and ; I wiped out R, g, P, T, D (after I got all
intrinsics), H, jabberwocks, N, Z and from a throne seating trices.

Was this the main cause of the jam-up on the plane of air?  My
previous ascension was about the same level and didn't have any sort
of problem with Titans.  I think I brought this on myself my removing
instances of D's and H's.  The Astral plane probably would have been
more of the same.

The monster rape was so bad I went through 2 life-savings and still
died, I maybe moved one space in that time.  A ring of conflict did
little good.  (Would having it on before I entered the level made a
difference?)

If you can't avoid being surrounded like this is there any good
strategy for dealing with the situation?  I was constantly stunned /
confused, and killing a summoning Titan did little good since by then
two or three more had taken its place.  And of course there is no
floor to engrave on.



